---
description: Build page layout convention (BuildShell)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Build pages

- URL shape: `/{category}/{build}` (e.g. `/birthday/slider`). Never put a build at a bare category root.
- Use `BuildShell` (`src/components/build-shell.tsx`) for every experiment/build route.
- Title + description at the **top** (centered).
- Interactive build content vertically + horizontally centered in the **middle** of the viewport.
- Top-left back pill → home. No logo on build pages.
- Metadata titles use hyphen separator: `%s - buildwithduy`.

# Registry + sitemap

- Every public build must be listed in `src/lib/builds.ts` (single source for homepage + sitemap).
- After adding a build: create `src/app/{path}/page.tsx`, add the `builds` entry, confirm `/sitemap.xml` includes it.
